[{"attendanceMandatory": "non mandatory", "clarityRating": 5, "class": "POLS320", "comment": "She was an amazing person and prof. I did struggle with the pop quizzes because literally I never got an A on them even when I read the material. Lots of reading every week but just try to understand the key concepts of the readings. Final group project and be prepared for cold calls. Also there are discussion posts about the week's materials. ", "createdByUser": false, "date": "2025-12-15 21:30:19 +0000 UTC", "difficultyRating": 4, "flagStatus": "UNFLAGGED", "grade": "A", "helpfulRating": 5, "id": "UmF0aW5nLTQyMjY2ODQ2", "isForCredit": true, "isForOnlineClass": false, "legacyId": 42266846, "ratingTags": "Get ready to read--Participation matters--Beware of pop quizzes", "teacherNote": null, "textbookUse": -1, "thumbsDownTotal": 0, "thumbsUpTotal": 0, "wouldTakeAgain": 1, "course_match_status": "exact"}, {"attendanceMandatory": "non mandatory", "clarityRating": 5, "class": "POLS320", "comment": "Awesome professor! class is always super interesting. discussion of current issues but prof makes a good effort at looking at facts and both sides of the issue. prof also encourages discussions in class even if you disagree. great learning environment, i never felt uncomfortable speaking in class. overall very interesting class and i learned a lot.", "createdByUser": false, "date": "2025-12-05 01:11:16 +0000 UTC", "difficultyRating": 1, "flagStatus": "UNFLAGGED", "grade": "A+", "helpfulRating": 5, "id": "UmF0aW5nLTQyMDQ3OTkw", "isForCredit": true, "isForOnlineClass": false, "legacyId": 42047990, "ratingTags": "Get ready to read--Group projects--Beware of pop quizzes", "teacherNote": null, "textbookUse": -1, "thumbsDownTotal": 0, "thumbsUpTotal": 0, "wouldTakeAgain": 1, "course_match_status": "exact"}, {"attendanceMandatory": "non mandatory", "clarityRating": 5, "class": "POLS320", "comment": "

I took this class partly because I saw an article that called it &#8220;far left ideology&#8221; but as someone who's actually active in the political space, this is some of the most entry level and tame sociology material ever&#128557;

She's nice and cheerful, can come across as a little intense if you're not being used to challenged on your perspective.", "createdByUser": false, "date": "2025-12-02 18:46:55 +0000 UTC", "difficultyRating": 1, "flagStatus": "UNFLAGGED", "grade": "A", "helpfulRating": 5, "id": "UmF0aW5nLTQxOTk1OTk5", "isForCredit": true, "isForOnlineClass": false, "legacyId": 41995999, "ratingTags": "Get ready to read--Beware of pop quizzes", "teacherNote": null, "textbookUse": -1, "thumbsDownTotal": 0, "thumbsUpTotal": 0, "wouldTakeAgain": 1, "course_match_status": "exact"}, {"attendanceMandatory": "non mandatory", "clarityRating": 5, "class": "POLS320", "comment": "Classes are more general discussion than lectures, but it encourages participation and is genuinely very interesting to listen to. This professor clearly cares about the subject matter she teaches, and she makes a serious effort to get to know her students and make them feel welcome to attend and speak up in class. Great class and great professor.", "createdByUser": false, "date": "2025-10-28 03:05:51 +0000 UTC", "difficultyRating": 3, "flagStatus": "UNFLAGGED", "grade": "A+", "helpfulRating": 5, "id": "UmF0aW5nLTQxNzY0NzE5", "isForCredit": true, "isForOnlineClass": false, "legacyId": 41764719, "ratingTags": "Get ready to read--Participation matters--Amazing lectures ", "teacherNote": null, "textbookUse": -1, "thumbsDownTotal": 0, "thumbsUpTotal": 0, "wouldTakeAgain": 1, "course_match_status": "exact"}]

